Subject: [PATCH] Add installer, swappable models and frontend layers (JS core,
 Vue/Quasar, Blade)

- payments:install: tick what to publish (config, migrations, model/listener/resolver stubs, Vue/Quasar, Blade)
- payments.models config: extend Payment/PaymentGateway in the app instead of copying them
- Headless JS core (state machine) with Vue 3/Quasar composable + PaymentDialog and a Blade checkout component
- Tests (PHP pure-logic + installer, JS core/dialog/blade) and GitHub Actions CI
